    "summary": "This rule limits psychic abilities for **ADEPTUS ASTARTES PSYKER** units that have it:\n\n- the unit's abilities state its **psyker level**, which is 1 or more\n- the name of every psychic ability states its **psychic level**, which is 1 or more\n- in a battle round, the psychic levels of all psychic abilities a friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES PSYKER** unit uses add up to at most its psyker level",
